HPROFILE - your Hollowdeep chronicle

Syntax: hprofile
        hprofile status

Shows your recorded room count, current character level, and earned
chronicle badges. This journal is saved on the game host and is shared
between your browser and native MUD-client sessions for the same character.

Start a chronicle with hquest accept first-steps. Explore and use hquest
survey to record different rooms. Use hquest claim first-steps after three
rooms to earn your first cosmetic badge.

Hprofile status is a compact display for phone screens: character name,
class, level, current/max health and mana, XP, gold, recorded places, and
badge count. It uses your current character and journal values without
changing them. Use hclass progress for training requirements and hquest
next for the next exploration goal.
